R=Path.cwd();O=R/'outputs/expanded/segmentation';a=json.load(open(O/'review/safer/combined-review.json'))
h='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>MMA / Limb ownership lab</title><style>body{background:#10171c;color:#edf0e9;font:15px/1.6 system-ui;margin:0}main{max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:30px}a{color:#22d3ee}h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,54px);font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-1.5px}p{color:#a3b0b7}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:#18232a;padding:18px;border:1px solid #35434a;border-radius:10px}img{width:100%;display:block}select{background:#1c2a33;color:#edf0e9;border:1px solid #485e69;padding:9px;border-radius:5px;font:inherit;margin:0 8px 16px 0}.note{border-left:2px solid #fb7185;padding:15px 20px;background:#1b252b;margin:20px 0}.parts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:20px 0}.part{background:#18232a;border:1px solid #35434a;padding:16px;border-radius:8px}.supported{color:#22d3ee}.mixed{color:#fb7185}.unclear{color:#a3b0b7}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font:12px/1.6 monospace}summary{cursor:pointer;color:#22d3ee}@media(max-width:750px){main{padding:18px}.grid,.parts{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main><a href="../index.html">← Evidence laboratory</a><h1>Every limb needs its own evidence.</h1><p>Four candidate routes on the same interleaved bodies: the original pose, removing the opponent mask, keeping the target mask, and removing only opponent pixels outside the target mask. Compare the pixels and the candidate. Then inspect the independent review of each body part.</p><select id="clip" aria-label="Frame"><option value="C">C · ground engagement at4s</option><option value="D">D · standing rear clinch at4s</option></select><select id="fighter" aria-label="Fighter clothing"><option value="fighter_red">Red shorts · Coral</option><option value="fighter_black">Black/gray shorts · Cyan</option></select><select id="variant" aria-label="Pose variant"><option value="baseline">Original RTMW candidate</option><option value="opponent_all_removed" selected>Opponent mask removed</option><option value="target_mask_only">Target mask only</option><option value="opponent_exclusive_removed">Preserve uncertain mask overlap</option></select><div class="grid"><div class="card"><strong>Original frame</strong><img id="original" alt="Original native frame"></div><div class="card"><strong id="title">Pose candidate</strong><img id="candidate" alt="Same frame with selected fighter pose candidates"></div></div><div id="parts" class="parts"></div><div class="note">A supported visible glove, knee or head region does not validate every landmark in that group. All variants use the same display threshold for comparison. Scores and mask overlap are not calibrated ownership probabilities. No whole-body winner was established; all alternate outputs and failures are retained.</div><details><summary>Inspect the independent review</summary><pre id="raw"></pre></details><p><a href="review/safer/review-summary.txt">Review summary</a> · <a href="safer_variants/results.json">Pose candidates</a> · <a href="sam2-rtmw-c-d-0-4.json">Original mask experiment</a></p></main><script>
const DATA=__DATA__,$=x=>document.getElementById(x),esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));function render(){let c=$('clip').value,f=$('fighter').value,v=$('variant').value,review=DATA.reviews.find(x=>x.clip===c),label=f==='fighter_red'?'Red':'Black/gray',r=review.assessments.find(x=>x.fighter_clothing===label&&x.condition===v);$('original').src=c+'-048-original.png';$('candidate').src='review/safer/'+c+'-048-'+f+'-'+v+'.png';$('title').textContent=$('variant').selectedOptions[0].textContent;$('parts').innerHTML=r?Object.entries(r.groups).map(([k,g])=>`<div class="part"><strong>${esc(k)}</strong><div class="${esc(g.status)}">${esc(g.status)}</div><p>${esc(g.evidence)}</p></div>`).join(''):'<p>Review unavailable for this candidate.</p>';$('raw').textContent=JSON.stringify(r,null,2)}for(let id of ['clip','fighter','variant'])$(id).onchange=render;render();
</script></body></html>'''
